[00:15.76]In front of me
{"在我面前"}
[00:17.60]I see it all
{"尽收眼底"}
[00:19.38]Untouchable
{"遥不可及"}
[00:21.51]Unbearable
{"难以承受"}
[00:23.08]My life goes by
{"时光流逝"}
[00:25.21]I'm powerless
{"无能为力"}
[00:26.86]What do I do
{"我该何去何从"}
[00:29.01]need to be free
{"渴望自由"}
[00:30.86]It may be far
{"或许遥远"}
[00:34.48]but we're unbreakable
{"但我们坚不可摧"}
[00:38.18]There is a way
{"存在出路"}
[00:42.06]fly away from misery
{"飞离苦海"}
[00:45.74]If we fall here
{"若在此坠落"}
[00:49.44]wishing for life endlessly
{"无尽祈盼生机"}
[00:53.16]I know that we'll
{"我坚信我们终将"}
[00:56.86]we'll find what's far away
{"寻得远方彼岸"}
[01:02.82]
[02:16.06]It seems pointless
{"看似徒劳"}
[02:17.75]what can I do
{"我能如何"}
[02:19.36]breaking apart
{"支离破碎"}
[02:21.57]my very soul
{"灵魂深处"}
[02:23.09]And still I try
{"仍奋力前行"}
[02:25.18]tired and all
{"疲惫不堪"}
[02:26.97]I think that I'll
{"我想我会"}
[02:29.06]continue on
{"继续坚持"}
[02:30.90]It may be far
{"或许遥远"}
[02:34.58]but we're unbreakable
{"但我们坚不可摧"}
[02:38.15]There is a way
{"总有一条路"}
[02:42.11]fly away from misery
{"从苦难中飞离"}
[02:45.75]If we fall here
{"若在此倒下"}
[02:49.37]wishing for life endlessly
{"无尽地渴求生命"}
[02:53.13]I know that we'll
{"我知道我们终将"}
[02:56.94]we'll find what's far away
{"寻得远方之物"}
